[3.961, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"answer\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"T1003 is OS Credential Dumping, which belongs to the Credential Access tactic. It involves extracting credential material such as password hashes from the operating system, for example from LSASS memory.\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"sources\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m[]\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\r\n  \u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"confident\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m: \u001b[0m\u001b[0;39mtrue\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
